  "description": [
    "Large cobblestones lie mostly embedded in the soft soil underfoot, but still manage to provide enough stability to traverse.  To the north, a small trail winds through what remains of a rose garden, and to the west there are rows upon rows of overgrown grapevines.  The sour scent of rotting fruit wafts through on a slight, sullen breeze."
